   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har ing&#xE5;tt ett ramavtal med hifab International AB avseende konsulttj&#xE4;nster inom utbildningsomr&#xE5;det som avser perioden fr.o.m. 2008-10-11 t.o.m. 2010-09-30. Ramavtalet best&#xE5;r av tv&#xE5; delar: Base Assignment (insats: 83030000) samt Specific Assignment (instas: 83030001)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has entered into a framwork agreement with Hifab International AB for consulting services and external advisors in the field of education sector development cooperation for the period of 2008-10-11 to 2010-09-30. The framework agreement consists of two parts: Base Assignment (contribution: 83030000) and Specific Assignment  (contribution: 83030001)</narrative>
